  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1004.07 Vision Examination Failure",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1004.07 Vision Examination Failure. Upon receipt of the information set forth in Saf-C 1004.05(b) and (c) that indicates the applicant cannot meet the vision requirements of Saf-C 1004.02, the applicant may complete the requirements of Saf-C 1004.08.\n\nSource. #8109, eff 6-24-04; ss by #10176, eff 8-23-12; ss by #13685, eff 8-5-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 1000)",
